OL,3,AMan jailed over racist Badenoch death
OL,4,Athreats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for sending the
OL,7,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,8,Femails threatening to shoot her dead.
OL,10,FEx-teacher Kieran Kyle sent three
OL,11,Femails on 2 May to the Tory party
OL,12,Fleader in which he made racist
OL,13,Freferences and claimed to have been in
OL,14,Fthe IRA, the court heard.
OL,16,FThe 43-year-old, from Gillingham in
OL,17,FKent, pleaded guilty on 22 September at
OL,18,FWestminster Magistrates' Court to two
OL,19,Fcounts of sending communications of an
OL,20,Findecent or offensive nature.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
